WEBVTT

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:18.870
Osamake: Romcom Where
The Childhood Friend Won't Lose

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:34.990
37th Hozumino High School Cultural Festival

00:01:45.210 --> 00:01:48.000
Hey. All ready?

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:49.070
Yeah.

00:01:53.790 --> 00:01:54.540
Oh?

00:01:56.340 --> 00:01:58.500
I'm worried, Maru-kun.

00:01:59.320 --> 00:02:00.980
About what?

00:02:00.980 --> 00:02:05.930
I'm worried that what will happen today 
might shock you so much that you cry.

00:02:06.290 --> 00:02:09.160
I could say the same about you, Senpai.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:14.870
To be honest...

00:02:15.380 --> 00:02:20.830
I thought this revenge thing of 
yours was really dumb at first.

00:02:20.830 --> 00:02:21.570
Hey!

00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:24.400
I mean, does what she did 
really justify that?

00:02:25.690 --> 00:02:27.510
You're asking that now?!

00:02:28.760 --> 00:02:32.380
But in a way, you can't help yourself 
when it comes to your first love.

00:02:32.860 --> 00:02:36.390
It's a curse, so it makes sense 
that you'd want revenge.

00:02:36.860 --> 00:02:38.230
So you'd better win.

00:02:38.230 --> 00:02:40.350
Yeah, you know I will!

00:02:47.330 --> 00:02:50.070
We have so much free time 
before our turn, though...

00:02:50.070 --> 00:02:54.080
Really? Do you not see that 
we just got five orders?

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:56.220
I-I was just about to take care of that!

00:02:56.970 --> 00:02:58.890
Well? How do I look?

00:02:59.430 --> 00:03:01.560
Honestly? Super cute.

00:03:01.560 --> 00:03:04.540
You're gonna make me blush, 
blurting it right out like that!

00:03:04.540 --> 00:03:05.380
Jeez!

00:03:07.100 --> 00:03:08.680
Maru...

00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:14.130
Guilty!

00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:14.640
Try to understand, Maru!

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:16.890
This hurts Goudo's heart 
a lot more than yours!

00:03:19.020 --> 00:03:20.200
Ow...

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:28.260
Kachi's group isn't here yet.

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:32.340
Where'd that come from?! I wasn't 
looking for Kachi or anything!

00:03:32.340 --> 00:03:33.490
Oh?

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:37.110
Anyway, someone's here to see you.

00:03:45.110 --> 00:03:46.180
Who is that?

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:52.000
Um...

00:03:52.320 --> 00:03:53.700
So who are you?

00:03:54.360 --> 00:03:56.180
It's been a while, Su-chan.

00:03:56.490 --> 00:03:58.050
Su-chan?

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:01.890
Wait, are you... Shirou?!

00:04:02.310 --> 00:04:05.830
Yep. I'm glad you figured it out.

00:04:06.210 --> 00:04:08.540
Wow, it's really you, Shirou!

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:11.550
It's been so long! How've you been?

00:04:11.550 --> 00:04:12.410
Wait!

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:16.260
Don't... come any closer.

00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:18.310
Huh? Oh, sorry.

00:04:18.850 --> 00:04:21.650
I'm glad you came, Shirou.

00:04:21.840 --> 00:04:23.140
That's a relief.

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:25.740
I thought you'd be upset.

00:04:25.970 --> 00:04:27.840
Of course not!

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:30.170
Well, you quit being an actor,

00:04:30.170 --> 00:04:32.130
and you didn't come to see me anymore.

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:37.510
So I thought you either forgot about 
me or didn't like me anymore.

00:04:37.510 --> 00:04:41.090
Oh... It's not like that. A lot happened.

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:46.150
I'm sorry. I know I promised to 
appear in a story you wrote.

00:04:49.190 --> 00:04:50.340
Shirou?

00:04:53.490 --> 00:04:55.300
You remembered.

00:04:55.660 --> 00:04:56.300
Huh?

00:04:56.300 --> 00:04:58.290
Nothing... Never mind.

00:04:58.700 --> 00:05:02.040
What have you been up to? 
You going to school?

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:06.510
Yeah. I started going back not 
long after you went away.

00:05:06.510 --> 00:05:08.780
Really? I'm glad to hear it.

00:05:09.560 --> 00:05:13.170
I made up my mind that I'd get stronger 
by the time I saw you again,

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:16.830
that I'd work hard at both school and 
sports to get rid of all my weaknesses.

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:20.520
But what I worked at the hardest 
on was writing stories.

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:22.740
And last year, I was finally 
recognized for it.

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:25.590
What? Did you debut as a novelist?

00:05:25.910 --> 00:05:27.600
Yeah, something like that.

00:05:27.600 --> 00:05:29.130
That's awesome!

00:05:29.130 --> 00:05:30.200
Thanks.

00:05:31.670 --> 00:05:34.390
All that time, I just wanted 
to catch up to you.

00:05:34.740 --> 00:05:37.260
I wanted to earn your recognition.

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:41.310
I worked hard and did all kinds of 
research so you'd say I was pretty.

00:05:41.560 --> 00:05:43.170
Pretty?

00:05:51.520 --> 00:05:52.680
Kachi?!

00:05:53.100 --> 00:05:54.330
That's right.

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:57.310
I'm Shirou.

00:05:57.310 --> 00:06:01.730
You misheard that as my name 
when my dad called me "Shiro."

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:02.410
Oh...

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:05.240
I wanted to see you so 
badly for all that time...

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:07.490
But I already had.

00:06:08.560 --> 00:06:11.650
Su-chan, I won the Akutami Award.

00:06:11.650 --> 00:06:15.550
I'm good enough to write a 
story you can act in now!

00:06:16.570 --> 00:06:19.380
Well? Do you think I'm pretty now?

00:06:19.870 --> 00:06:23.240
I tried so hard because it bugged 
me that you thought I was a boy.

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:26.750
They're even putting my 
picture in magazines now.

00:06:27.110 --> 00:06:28.070
Did you know?

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:31.270
Yeah... of course.

00:06:31.970 --> 00:06:32.990
But...

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:48.540
I was so sad, so vexed...

00:06:49.640 --> 00:06:52.630
I'm sorry! I had absolutely no idea!

00:06:52.630 --> 00:06:56.040
It's okay. You remembered our promise.

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:57.150
Kachi...

00:06:57.150 --> 00:06:58.000
Su-chan...

00:06:58.460 --> 00:07:00.790
Can I start calling you "Su-chan" again?

00:07:00.790 --> 00:07:02.420
Uh... S-Sure...

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:05.450
Could I ask you not to 
call me "Shirou," though?

00:07:05.450 --> 00:07:07.690
Now that you know I'm a girl and all.

00:07:07.690 --> 00:07:09.530
O-Okay. What should I call you?

00:07:10.670 --> 00:07:11.780
Shiro.

00:07:12.190 --> 00:07:12.740
Huh?

00:07:12.930 --> 00:07:18.090
It always drove me crazy to hear 
you call Shida-san "Kuro."

00:07:18.090 --> 00:07:21.300
If she's Kuro, then I want to be Shiro.

00:07:21.570 --> 00:07:24.300
Okay, got it. I'll call 
you "Shiro" from now on.

00:07:24.300 --> 00:07:26.000
Okay, Su-chan.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:27.420
But wait, Kachi...

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:28.560
Shiro!

00:07:28.560 --> 00:07:29.700
Oh, sorry.

00:07:30.020 --> 00:07:33.840
Shiro, what brought all of this on now?

00:07:34.270 --> 00:07:37.550
Remember when you told me why 
you quit as a child actor?

00:07:37.550 --> 00:07:38.180
Yeah.

00:07:38.670 --> 00:07:41.750
I had no idea something that 
terrible had happened.

00:07:42.720 --> 00:07:46.860
And yet, deep inside, I was 
still blaming you for it.

00:07:47.170 --> 00:07:49.620
I realized that was wrong of me.

00:07:49.620 --> 00:07:52.060
So I decided to tell you myself.

00:07:52.870 --> 00:07:56.150
Plus, today's the day you 
return to the stage.

00:07:56.150 --> 00:07:57.870
Yeah, it is.

00:07:58.350 --> 00:08:00.020
Look forward to seeing me.

00:08:00.020 --> 00:08:03.740
My acting and the plot you 
wrote are gonna come together!

00:08:04.190 --> 00:08:06.570
It's gonna be fire! I'll make sure of it!

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:08.530
I've wanted...

00:08:09.160 --> 00:08:11.380
to hear you say that for a long time.

00:08:22.950 --> 00:08:26.140
I had a feeling that kid in 
the photo was you, Kachi-san.

00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:30.620
He's going to be calling 
me "Shiro" from now on.

00:08:30.880 --> 00:08:33.740
That doesn't mean anyone's won or lost.

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:37.320
If you think that means you've won,
 you're pretty short-sighted.

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:41.580
<b><i>Orange Tabby vs. Shiba Inuby</i></b>

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:46.280
I never would've guessed Kachi was Shirou.

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:48.630
Hey, Haru!

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:50.820
If you have time to kill, wanna walk
 around the festival with me?

00:08:50.820 --> 00:08:52.370
You overheard, didn't you?

00:08:52.370 --> 00:08:53.770
What do you mean?

00:08:53.770 --> 00:08:55.060
You know what I mean.

00:08:55.450 --> 00:08:58.550
So I'm "Kuro" and Kachi-san is "Shiro," huh?

00:08:58.880 --> 00:09:01.270
That makes it sound like I'm the dark one.

00:09:01.460 --> 00:09:03.280
Wait, you're not jealous, are you?

00:09:03.280 --> 00:09:05.430
Wha... Of course I'm not!

00:09:05.430 --> 00:09:08.610
I'm technically the one going 
out with you right now.

00:09:08.610 --> 00:09:10.890
I don't even consider that loser a rival.

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:13.520
You really don't like Shiro at all, huh?

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:18.160
<b>Shiro...</b>

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:17.720
I don't know exactly why, 
but I <i>hate</i> the sound of that!

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:19.790
What's so funny?!

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:25.670
Oh, just thinking that I'm the only 
one you ever rant at like that.

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:28.340
That's your way of asking 
for attention, huh?

00:09:29.740 --> 00:09:30.900
Huh? Hey, wait!

00:09:30.900 --> 00:09:32.210
Stay away!

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:34.880
<i>That's</i> what you say to me?

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:39.260
You're the one who's always saying 
way more embarrassing things!

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:41.900
I told you, I can't stand being criticized!

00:09:41.900 --> 00:09:43.730
I'm not mentally prepared for that!

00:09:43.730 --> 00:09:46.960
I'm not sure you have the dexterity or 
composure to act like an older sister.

00:09:46.960 --> 00:09:48.850
Shut up! Shut up!

00:09:49.450 --> 00:09:53.190
Okay, I'm sorry. I won't say 
anything to fluster you anymore.

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:57.680
But... you can when we're alone.

00:09:57.680 --> 00:09:58.830
What do you even want?

00:09:58.820 --> 00:10:01.780
37th Hozumino High School Cultural Festival

00:09:58.830 --> 00:10:00.490
Both!

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:13.630
<b>Udon</b>

00:10:14.990 --> 00:10:17.000
The closing ceremony's coming up.

00:10:17.350 --> 00:10:18.130
Yeah.

00:10:19.780 --> 00:10:21.050
It's almost time.

00:10:21.320 --> 00:10:22.060
Yeah.

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:27.160
I don't know what you'll try to 
do for revenge after this...

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:29.560
But I want you to know this.

00:10:29.860 --> 00:10:33.430
I was opposed to the idea 
of you acting again.

00:10:33.430 --> 00:10:36.400
But if you're optimistic 
and willing to do it,

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:37.440
I want to support you.

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:40.530
I want you to do what you want to do, 
without worrying about anything.

00:10:41.360 --> 00:10:42.330
Kuro...

00:10:46.860 --> 00:10:47.630
Haru...

00:10:53.360 --> 00:10:56.110
Our relationship's been reset now.

00:10:56.110 --> 00:10:59.120
Whatever you do from now 
on is none of my concern.

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:05.820
Even if you ask Kachi-san out... 
it's none of my concern.

00:11:10.990 --> 00:11:14.070
Jeez... Why are you making 
me go through all this?

00:11:15.990 --> 00:11:18.530
Even if I am like an older sister to you...

00:11:19.690 --> 00:11:20.320
Sorry!

00:11:20.980 --> 00:11:21.960
Kuro!

00:11:27.310 --> 00:11:29.280
I'll be watching, okay?

00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:40.140
I'm sorry.

00:11:40.970 --> 00:11:45.970
Osamake: Romcom Where
The Childhood Friend Won't Lose

00:11:40.970 --> 00:11:45.970
<b>\hEpisode 3: 
I Have Achieved My Revenge on My First Love</b>

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:50.930
<b>Confession Festival Venue</b>

00:11:47.160 --> 00:11:48.750
Muscular!

00:11:48.750 --> 00:11:50.690
You're huge! Huge!

00:11:51.090 --> 00:11:53.390
Next up is Hagiwara Reo-kun!

00:11:54.330 --> 00:11:58.680
I was planning to confess if I won at 
the tennis inter-high this year...

00:11:59.770 --> 00:12:01.650
But I didn't!

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:06.570
From class 3-C, Momoyama-kun!

00:12:07.020 --> 00:12:08.620
Okay, go for it.

00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:11.990
There's someone I like.

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:16.710
T-Takenaka Kanae-san!

00:12:17.190 --> 00:12:20.660
Ever since we worked on the athletic 
festival committee together...

00:12:21.710 --> 00:12:24.390
I've liked you!

00:12:26.510 --> 00:12:29.310
Please go out with me!

00:12:30.760 --> 00:12:32.420
Guilty!

00:12:30.760 --> 00:12:32.970
Takenaka! Takenaka!

00:12:30.760 --> 00:12:33.020
Go! Go!

00:12:34.320 --> 00:12:35.930
It would be my pleasure!

00:12:44.820 --> 00:12:46.280
<b>Almost time</b>

00:12:44.820 --> 00:12:46.280
<b>Thanks</b>

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:48.210
Guess it's almost time.

00:12:48.210 --> 00:12:49.890
Well? Think you can win?

00:12:50.900 --> 00:12:55.290
Ever since I was little, I've always 
flipped an internal switch before acting.

00:12:56.140 --> 00:12:57.870
Once that switch is flipped,

00:12:58.190 --> 00:13:00.240
I can be a hero or anything else I want.

00:13:01.220 --> 00:13:03.260
Now, let's welcome him to the stage!

00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:09.960
As you all know, our last participant is...

00:13:10.190 --> 00:13:11.970
Abe Mitsuru-kun!

00:13:13.720 --> 00:13:16.140
Hello, I'm Abe Mitsuru.

00:13:16.750 --> 00:13:20.750
I'm here today to share my feelings 
with a certain young lady.

00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:22.880
But I'm not good at talking,

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:25.860
so I'd like to tell her 
through song and dance.

00:13:29.600 --> 00:13:30.860
Kachi Shirokusa-chan,

00:13:31.150 --> 00:13:33.030
this song is for you.

00:13:34.090 --> 00:13:35.470
By Acid Snake...

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:39.000
<b>7th Confession Festival</b>

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:38.270
This is "Child Star".

00:15:00.980 --> 00:15:03.140
I thought you couldn't stand onstage anymore

00:15:03.140 --> 00:15:05.370
after the trauma you went through?

00:15:06.160 --> 00:15:08.780
I can't complain about past traumas

00:15:09.110 --> 00:15:11.120
when I'm trying to look 
good for the girl I love!

00:15:14.270 --> 00:15:15.900
This is what I wanted to see.

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:53.050
Maru! Maru! Maru!

00:15:43.730 --> 00:15:46.120
I guess you are the real deal.

00:15:50.330 --> 00:15:51.560
He did it.

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:53.410
You get it now, right?

00:15:53.410 --> 00:15:55.150
This guy's the real deal!

00:15:55.150 --> 00:15:58.650
Maru Sueharu of class 2-B, 
member of the entertainment club!

00:15:58.650 --> 00:16:01.030
And now it's time for our real production...

00:16:01.210 --> 00:16:03.800
Maru Sueharu's confession!

00:16:06.820 --> 00:16:08.490
Kachi Shirokusa-san...

00:16:10.270 --> 00:16:12.130
No, that's not right.

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:13.440
Shiro...

00:16:14.610 --> 00:16:15.420
Yes?

00:16:15.990 --> 00:16:19.900
I... <i>was</i> in love with you.

00:16:20.340 --> 00:16:21.220
Huh?

00:16:21.590 --> 00:16:25.690
So when I heard that you'd 
started dating Senpai,

00:16:25.690 --> 00:16:27.170
it was a huge shock.

00:16:27.690 --> 00:16:31.630
The reason I'm on this stage is because 
I saw Abe-senpai as competition,

00:16:32.600 --> 00:16:35.290
and I wanted to get revenge on both of you.

00:16:35.710 --> 00:16:37.110
Su-chan?

00:16:37.530 --> 00:16:39.040
But now I realize

00:16:39.570 --> 00:16:42.070
who's more important to me than anyone.

00:16:51.510 --> 00:16:52.780
Shida Kuroha...

00:17:00.260 --> 00:17:09.020
I love you!

00:17:19.820 --> 00:17:20.960
Oh?

00:17:24.340 --> 00:17:26.820
Kuro! I finally see it now!

00:17:26.820 --> 00:17:29.200
You were always right by my side!

00:17:29.630 --> 00:17:32.740
It was having you there that saved me!

00:17:35.470 --> 00:17:36.950
I'm sorry for everything!

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:39.440
I'll probably make even more 
trouble for you from now on,

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:41.910
but I need you!

00:17:42.320 --> 00:17:45.910
Kuro, I love you! Please go out with me!

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:01.540
No.

00:18:04.190 --> 00:18:04.810
Huh?

00:18:05.650 --> 00:18:06.470
Nope!

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:08.380
Whoa, whoa...

00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:09.220
Wait...

00:18:09.530 --> 00:18:10.530
Are you serious?

00:18:11.510 --> 00:18:12.840
Totally serious!

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:25.370
Why the hell?!

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:29.330
37th Hozumino High School Cultural Festival

00:18:31.090 --> 00:18:34.300
Senpai, were you playing 
the bad guy on purpose?

00:18:35.060 --> 00:18:36.300
Why do you ask?

00:18:36.900 --> 00:18:39.740
"Child Star" is Sueharu's best song.

00:18:39.740 --> 00:18:42.010
It makes no sense that you'd use it.

00:18:42.480 --> 00:18:45.840
Oh? I guess you're as 
sharp as the rumors say.

00:18:46.040 --> 00:18:47.690
It's true.

00:18:48.090 --> 00:18:50.150
Sueharu's a blockhead, though.

00:18:50.150 --> 00:18:50.820
True.

00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:53.900
I get the gist of what this was all about,

00:18:54.210 --> 00:18:57.150
but why did you decide to play the bad guy?

00:18:57.770 --> 00:19:01.610
Shirokusa-chan is like a sister to me.

00:19:02.230 --> 00:19:05.950
Shirokusa-chan loved 
Maru-kun for a long time,

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:08.290
even after they stopped seeing each other.

00:19:08.760 --> 00:19:13.430
But then she said she loved him so much 
that she wanted to get him to love her,

00:19:13.430 --> 00:19:14.890
then reject him.

00:19:14.890 --> 00:19:16.800
Ah, I get it.

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:19.510
So she tried pretty hard 
to make herself look good,

00:19:19.510 --> 00:19:22.060
but Maru-kun just wouldn't confess to her.

00:19:22.670 --> 00:19:24.320
And in the midst of all that,

00:19:24.320 --> 00:19:27.430
Shida-san ended up confessing 
to Maru-kun first.

00:19:28.010 --> 00:19:30.260
It was a relief when he didn't accept,

00:19:30.260 --> 00:19:32.880
but they were still close enough that 
she couldn't let her guard down.

00:19:33.360 --> 00:19:35.610
And while she was stressing 
over what she should do,

00:19:35.610 --> 00:19:40.020
she lied that she was going out 
with me in the heat of the moment.

00:19:40.020 --> 00:19:42.480
She could've just taken it back right after.

00:19:42.480 --> 00:19:44.890
I told her that, too, but...

00:19:45.610 --> 00:19:49.110
Coming out and saying it myself 
would be admitting defeat.

00:19:49.460 --> 00:19:50.820
...was her answer.

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:55.580
So you played the bad guy to get him 
to focus his resentment on you,

00:19:55.580 --> 00:19:59.290
and Kachi approached Sueharu 
in the meantime, huh?

00:19:59.290 --> 00:20:00.020
Right.

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:02.860
Why even bother when you don't 
get anything out of it?

00:20:02.860 --> 00:20:04.360
But I do.

00:20:04.360 --> 00:20:04.920
Huh?

00:20:05.450 --> 00:20:09.880
I'm a huge fan of the genius 
child actor Maru Sueharu.

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:14.430
If it brings him back into acting, 
I don't mind being hated.

00:20:16.500 --> 00:20:17.940
Senpai...

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:21.330
Damn, you're such a good guy.

00:20:21.520 --> 00:20:24.260
But you hate that about me, don't you?

00:20:24.260 --> 00:20:26.280
Yeah, it's true.

00:20:26.570 --> 00:20:29.830
I hate how damn confident you are.

00:20:31.680 --> 00:20:34.140
Well, Kachi's pretty intense,

00:20:34.140 --> 00:20:38.010
but the way Shida-chan made him fall for 
her in a month and a half is just scary.

00:20:38.210 --> 00:20:41.110
So I guess Shida-chan won in the end?

00:20:41.500 --> 00:20:44.650
I think they all lost, actually.

00:20:50.780 --> 00:20:56.540
Stupid Haru! Stupid Haru! Stupid Haru! 
Stupid Haru! Stupid Haru! Stupid Haru!

00:20:56.970 --> 00:20:59.190
Stupid Haru!

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:01.660
She's regretting the hell out of it now.

00:21:01.660 --> 00:21:02.190
Right?

00:21:02.590 --> 00:21:06.550
She loved Sueharu so much, 
she just couldn't forgive him

00:21:06.550 --> 00:21:09.380
when he rejected her right when 
it was about to come to fruition.

00:21:09.730 --> 00:21:12.180
So she rejected him to get even,

00:21:12.180 --> 00:21:15.440
but she still loves him, 
so now she's drowning in regret.

00:21:16.450 --> 00:21:20.020
They all tried to get one of the others to 
love them just so they could reject them,

00:21:20.020 --> 00:21:22.500
and now none of them is 
with the one they wanted.

00:21:23.050 --> 00:21:25.020
What a stupid ending.

00:21:25.020 --> 00:21:27.490
Emotions can't be controlled.

00:21:28.120 --> 00:21:32.930
I bet both Shida-san and Shirokusa-chan 
are very pure and devoted at heart.

00:21:33.180 --> 00:21:35.140
Are you just so jaded that it's warped you?

00:21:36.260 --> 00:21:39.910
But I guess that's just how first love goes.

00:21:40.390 --> 00:21:44.390
Yeah. That's first love for you.

00:21:44.690 --> 00:21:48.820
Why the hell? Why the hell? Why the hell?

00:21:48.820 --> 00:21:49.710
Why...

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:53.910
Why the hell?!

00:23:31.720 --> 00:23:32.810
Isn't this...

00:23:33.420 --> 00:23:34.880
Onii-chan?!
